            "code": "\n\tstateInfo \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetRowToJSON(system.kanoa.asset.getStates({\u0027stateId\u0027:value[\u0027stateId\u0027] or -1}),0)\n\tstateInfo[\u0027stateName\u0027] \u003d stateInfo[\u0027stateName\u0027] or \u0027\u0027\n\t\n\tif value[\u0027stateCategoryPath\u0027] and value[\u0027stateId\u0027] is None:\n\t\tstateInfo[\u0027stateCategoryId\u0027] \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.getFieldValue(\u0027stateCategoryId\u0027, system.kanoa.asset.getStateCategory({\u0027stateCategoryPath\u0027: value[\u0027stateCategoryPath\u0027]}))\n\t\tstateInfo[\u0027stateCategoryPath\u0027] \u003d value[\u0027stateCategoryPath\u0027]\n\t\t\n\tif value[\u0027stateId\u0027] is None: \n\t\tstateInfo[\u0027enabled\u0027] \u003d True\n\t\tstateInfo[\u0027stateTypeId\u0027] \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.getFieldValue(\u0027stateTypeId\u0027, system.kanoa.asset.getStateType({\u0027stateTypeName\u0027: \u0027Unplanned Downtime\u0027}))\n\t\n\treturn stateInfo",
            "type": "script"
          }
        ],
