                      "code": "\t#Tooling is the type of the nine tool statuses Kanoa reserves; a state of that type never counts in OEE, so it\u0027s only\n\t#offered for a state that already has it (868mwzgc8). value is the state\u0027s type\n\treturn [{\u0027value\u0027: row[\u0027stateTypeId\u0027], \u0027label\u0027: row[\u0027stateTypeName\u0027]} for row in system.kanoa.asset.getStateType({\u0027enabled\u0027: True})\n\t\t\tif row[\u0027stateTypeName\u0027] !\u003d \u0027Tooling\u0027 or row[\u0027stateTypeId\u0027] \u003d\u003d value]",
